                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does Mother's Day drive for gift-focused D2C?</h3>
                                        <p>10-25% of Q2 revenue. Jewelry + fine jewelry + fragrance peak higher (15-30%).</p>
                                        <h3>What is Father's Day vs Mother's Day size?</h3>
                                        <p>Father's Day typically 40-60% smaller than Mother's Day in most markets. But growing rapidly.</p>
                                        <h3>Are these growing in India?</h3>
